{"engine": "Kokoro v1.0", "voices": {"t": "af_heart", "s": "am_michael"}, "clips": {"t|One symbol at a time. No calculator yet.": "w2/t-42f15b6980.mp3", "t|x̄, “x-bar”: the answer they ask for. Park it.": "w2/t-be69c010f0.mp3", "t|This long line?": "w2/t-e20dea233c.mp3", "s|A fraction!": "w2/s-b683c46592.mp3", "t|So: divide.": "w2/t-8cb62d3467.mp3", "t|And Σ?": "w2/t-60576b44f4.mp3", "s|…?": "w2/s-b81bbdc0e2.mp3", "t|Σ means SUM. Add up the list after it.": "w2/t-9bb6a4d4a7.mp3", "t|xᵢ is the list. i is the position: x₁ = 12, x₂ = 15 …": "w2/t-4ce3f73256.mp3", "t|And n?": "w2/t-da18ea3041.mp3", "s|How many values: 5!": "w2/s-b586769d33.mp3", "t|Translate. n becomes 5.": "w2/t-e1fd8a617a.mp3", "t|xᵢ becomes the whole list. Σ is still waiting.": "w2/t-8f15ccb2b3.mp3", "t|Now Σ melts…": "w2/t-be85db4f33.mp3", "t|…and every comma becomes a plus.": "w2/t-513876fdd9.mp3", "t|Every symbol is a number. That line already earns marks.": "w2/t-0bf193439c.mp3", "t|Now the calculator.": "w2/t-c79d4ab6de.mp3", "s|90 divided by 5 is 18!": "w2/s-9f7b71607a.mp3", "t|18 is the balance point. The distances left and right cancel out: zero.": "w2/t-bb9dcca7c8.mp3", "t|The mean’s big sister. Same reading.": "w2/t-fec848a80a.mp3", "s|Fraction: divide!": "w2/s-ac7a7f159e.mp3", "t|Σ again. But now in front of a whole bracket.": "w2/t-d64b22e81f.mp3", "t|Do the bracket for every value. Then add.": "w2/t-3b3533ab15.mp3", "t|Inside: each value minus x̄.": "w2/t-93a0feae9e.mp3", "s|x̄ is 18!": "w2/s-1b4f231c7f.mp3", "t|Then square the bracket.": "w2/t-72ae4cca8b.mp3", "t|Bottom: n − 1.": "w2/t-16ee4da3d6.mp3", "s|5 − 1 = 4.": "w2/s-2e92c32e2c.mp3", "t|How many values?": "w2/t-14cc31bc01.mp3", "s|Five.": "w2/s-8f23cbc5a9.mp3", "t|So: five empty brackets.": "w2/t-55603b9618.mp3", "t|One value in each.": "w2/t-67fb144df9.mp3", "t|What comes next?": "w2/t-d410ec821d.mp3", "s|Minus!": "w2/s-f48281cb25.mp3", "t|In every bracket.": "w2/t-f58f84d32e.mp3", "t|Then?": "w2/t-99ca87e60f.mp3", "s|x̄. We have it: 18.": "w2/s-83ffc59ec2.mp3", "s|Square!": "w2/s-261a8623d5.mp3", "t|Σ melts. Commas become plus.": "w2/t-5360f5606d.mp3", "t|n − 1 becomes 5 − 1.": "w2/t-a1cab61b82.mp3", "t|Half the mark, and no calculator yet.": "w2/t-c341009fcb.mp3", "t|See it. Each bracket is a distance from the mean.": "w2/t-b9aafad160.mp3", "t|Left is negative. Added up, they cancel to zero.": "w2/t-30a3d598e0.mp3", "t|So we square. Each distance becomes a real square.": "w2/t-4933bca986.mp3", "t|No more negatives.": "w2/t-589feefc59.mp3", "t|Total area 98, shared by 4: the average square.": "w2/t-ec65e1da39.mp3", "s|24.5!": "w2/s-32c9f432e5.mp3", "t|Its side is the standard deviation: about 4.95.": "w2/t-8a1e68cfbf.mp3", "t|√ undoes the square. Back to marks.": "w2/t-90363dbf51.mp3", "s|About 4.95.": "w2/s-ec88e1b498.mp3", "t|A typical mark is 4.95 from the mean.": "w2/t-b1bfa381b9.mp3", "t|Spot the two changes.": "w2/t-43f096c7ce.mp3", "s|μ instead of x̄. N instead of n − 1.": "w2/s-056d7ce1f0.mp3", "t|“All”, “every”, “entire”: population. Divide by N.": "w2/t-fd10e91d0e.mp3", "t|“Sample”, “randomly selected”: divide by n − 1.": "w2/t-63f435f0c7.mp3", "t|Which numbers do we have?": "w2/t-5584baae93.mp3", "s|s = 4.95 and x̄ = 18.": "w2/s-16f73db462.mp3", "t|Spread is 27.5% of the mean. No units.": "w2/t-104140e0d3.mp3", "t|First check: probabilities add to 1.": "w2/t-9d07261fb9.mp3", "s|1 ✓": "w2/s-64831cf7a7.mp3", "t|Each x times its probability.": "w2/t-51a368c0a6.mp3", "s|0, 0.3, 0.8, 0.6.": "w2/s-86691fafb4.mp3", "t|Σ melts. No dividing by n.": "w2/t-99a0c56562.mp3", "s|1.7 complaints a day.": "w2/s-b2e1538b23.mp3", "t|Same story as s². Subtract, square, times P(x), add.": "w2/t-f930bb73f5.mp3", "s|0.81. SD is 0.9.": "w2/s-feaefeccaa.mp3"}}